(text "Used for buffering in pipelines, we dont neccessarily want to" (rect 544 320 890 333)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "or have to control the enable and clr pins so we set them constant." (rect 544 336 929 349)(font "DejaVu Sans Condensed" (font_size 8)))
(text "no harm in keeping it active," (rect 568 232 807 246)(font "Cascadia Mono" (font_size 9)))
(text "we are just trying to pass it" (rect 568 248 807 262)(font "Cascadia Mono" (font_size 9)))
(text "through every clock. The clk" (rect 568 264 799 278)(font "Cascadia Mono" (font_size 9)))
(text "acts as the buffer" (rect 568 280 716 294)(font "Cascadia Mono" (font_size 9)))
